BLOCKCHAIN STATUS:

Pending
Confirmed
Failed

OFFICIAL STATUS:

Pending Review
Verified
Rejected
Needs Review

Example:

Blockchain:

CONFIRMED

Official:

PENDING REVIEW

After an admin verifies it:

Blockchain:

CONFIRMED

Official:

VERIFIED

This distinction must appear throughout the UI.

